i","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sh4i-yurei/claude-config/milestones/3","html_url":"https://github.com/sh4i-yurei/claude-config/milestone/3","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sh4i-yurei/claude-config/milestones/3/labels","id":18892617,"node_id":"MI_kwDOUrsrDs4BIEdJ","number":3,"title":"Workflow · M1: Global GitHub workflow","description":"Every repository gets its labels from one file, issues open complete through one tool, and the guard refuses the shortcut. Done when G2 to G4 are on main.","creator":{"login":"sh4i-yurei","id":232996764,"node_id":"U_kgDODeM_nA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232996764?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei","html_url":"https://github.com/sh4i-yurei","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh4i-yurei/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-10-24T18:38:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:05:30Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-26T04:05:30Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:05:30Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Project, step, and reason\n\nGlobal development workflow, follow-up to G3a (#20). The issue tool adds only the form's type: label and one scope: label, so it can't open a tech-debt issue, which needs tech-debt and a debt: type and origin label (decisions 27 and 28), or mark an issue deferred or workflow-exception.\n\n### What changes\n\nThe issue file gains an optional labels list. Each label must be a global label in tools/workflow/labels.toml other than a type: or scope: label, which the form and the scope key already own; anything else is refused before any change, naming the label.\n\n### Done when\n\nAn issue file with labels = [\"tech-debt\", \"debt:code\", \"debt:accidental\"] opens an issue carrying them, a type: or scope: label in the list is refused, a label not in labels.toml is refused, and the round's review passes.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sh4i-yurei/claude-config/issues/23/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sh4i-yurei/claude-config/issues/23/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}